      "trackName": "Pong : Classic Arcade Game",
      "description": "How long can you keep the rally alive?\n\nPong transforms classic paddle gameplay into an endless survival challenge. Drag to control your paddle, return every shot, and build the longest run you can.\n\nThe opponent never misses. Your challenge is to stay focused as the ball gradually accelerates, reaching 1.5 times its previous speed every ten points.\n\nFeatures:\n\n- Simple drag controls\n- Increasing ball speed\n- Endless score-based gameplay\n- Recent and best score tracking\n- Game Center leaderboards\n- Quick pause and resume\n- Optional one-time purchase to remove ads\n\nJump in for a quick rally or chase a new personal best.",
